---
import Text from '../../layouts/Text.astro';
import { site } from '../../config';
---

<Text lang="en" title="Privacy">
  <p>
    This website is deliberately lean: no cookies, no tracking, no advertising and no embedded third-party
    services. Fonts and videos are loaded directly from this website.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible person</h2>
  <p>{site.person}, <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The website is served via GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., USA). When you visit, GitHub processes technically
    necessary data such as IP address, date and time in order to deliver the site and protect it from abuse.
  </p>

  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact me via the form or by email, I only use your details to answer your request and organise the
    tour. Your data is not passed on.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request information about your stored data at any time, as well as its correction or deletion. Write
    to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</Text>
